<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">また警察からの指導により、公道での入庫待ちは出来ません</p></div></div><div id="comp-mj0r52at" role="" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mj0r52at-container comp-mj0r52at wixui-box" dir="ltr"><div aria-hidden="true" class="jdJeEr NYfD3h inner-box wixui-box"></div><div id="comp-mj0r52az" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mj0r52az wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">①料金体制</span></p></div><div id="comp-mj0r52b3" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mj0r52b3 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">臨時体制となる1月1日～15日の間、最初の1時間が1,000円、以降30分毎500円加算（上限無し）</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;</p></div></div><div id="comp-mis8lgpy" role="" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mis8lgpy-container comp-mis8lgpy wixui-box" dir="ltr"><div aria-hidden="true" class="jdJeEr NYfD3h inner-box wixui-box"></div><div id="comp-mis8di5j" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mis8di5j wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">②臨時駐車場入口</p></div><div id="comp-mis8ffi1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mis8ffi1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">１月１日～４日は境内南側に「御蔭通入口（右折入庫不可」と「河合大路西入口（下鴨本通り南行から左折）」を開設いたします　※地図参照</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text">　開設時間：午前８時３０分～午後５時（４日は午後４時まで）</p></div></div><div id="comp-mj0r78mg" data-testid="imageX" class="i4P7Vt comp-mj0r78mg ZYZJBv wixui-image"><div class="YX2qkL" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mj0r78mg"><div data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mj0r78mg"><wow-image id="img-comp-mj0r78mg" data-is-responsive="true" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mj0r78mg&quot;,&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;parallaxSpeed&quot;:1.5,&quot;sourceSets&quot;:[],&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;3d2299_614735f4f6234f8f8ef1a07724e9fd64~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:559,&quot;height&quot;:502,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;HPの修正（駐車場関係）_edited.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HPの修正（駐車場関係）_edited.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;scrollEffect&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;focalPoint&quot;:null},&quot;hasAnimation&quot;:false,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;allowFullGIFTransformation&quot;:false}" data-has-ssr-src="true" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-mj0r78mg" class="qR3Oj6"><picture><img loading="lazy" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3d2299_614735f4f6234f8f8ef1a07724e9fd64~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_101,h_90,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/HP%E3%81%AE%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3%EF%BC%88%E9%A7%90%E8%BB%8A%E5%A0%B4%E9%96%A2%E4%BF%82%EF%BC%89_edited.jpg" alt="HPの修正（駐車場関係）_edited.jpg" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%"/></picture></wow-image></div></div></div></div><div id="comp-mj0r9p0q" role="" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mj0r9p0q-container comp-mj0r9p0q wixui-box" dir="ltr"><div aria-hidden="true" class="jdJeEr NYfD3h inner-box wixui-box"></div><div id="comp-mis8l64r" role="" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mis8l64r-container comp-mis8l64r wixui-box" dir="ltr"><div aria-hidden="true" class="jdJeEr NYfD3h inner-box wixui-box"></div><div id="comp-mis8h2xi" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mis8h2xi wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wi